export anchor MoonlitZenStyle:
    number: 273
    screen: CloudFiles
    name: Moonlit zen
    idea: An ink black garden of few things, where a moon shows how full storage is, raked sand lines separate the files and the selected file rests like a stone in a ringed pebble panel.
    base: dark
    palette:
        inkBlack: #0e0e10, page and style sheet
        stone: #18181b, the pebble details panel
        shadowStone: #1f1e22, the unlit moon and the selected row glow
        sand: #2e2d31, rings and tracks
        rake: #3a383d, raked lines, outlines and nav dots
        ink: #e7e3d9, text
        muted: #a39f96, meta, labels and icons
        moon: #ece6d4, moon, primary button, selected stone, current dot and upload thread
        paleGold: #dcc98f, the Starred word and focus
        nightInk: #1d1806, text on moon
    type:
        Light Mincho serif headings in Hiragino Mincho ProN, Yu Mincho,
        Noto Serif, Source Serif Pro, Georgia, and a light sans for text in
        Hiragino Sans, Yu Gothic UI, Segoe UI, system-ui. Base 15.5px at
        weight 300 and 1.7. The title is 48px serif at 300, the details
        title 24px serif, file names 16.5px sans at 400, meta 13.5px muted
        and the panel label 13px tracked 0.2em.
    layout:
        Wide 64px gutters. A quiet header has Brightwork Drive in widely
        tracked serif and an underline search. Three columns follow. A
        180px nav lists the five places with a small ring dot each, filled
        moon for My files, and below it a 120px moon whose lit part, about
        two thirds from the right, shows 64.2 GB of 100 GB. The middle has
        the breadcrumb, the light serif title, a moon pill Upload, an
        outline pill New folder and a List or Grid text switch marked by a
        moon dot. Files are unboxed rows of icon, name, status word, a meta
        line such as modified 27 Oct by Priya Nair, and size, each
        separated by three raked wavy lines. The selected file sits on a
        moon coloured stone ringed by two raked circles, with a faint glow.
        A 340px pebble panel with concentric raked rings in its corner
        holds Details, a pale preview, the serif name, facts and the three
        pill buttons. Below 1180px the pebble moves under the files.
        Below 760px the moon sits beside the nav and all stacks.
    spacing: An 8px unit used generously. 64px gutters and column gaps, 14px row padding, 56px above the moon.
    density: Sparse. One line of meta per file and nothing boxed except the pebble.
    corners: Round and organic. 21px pill buttons, a 48 to 56px pebble and a slightly uneven stone.
    borders: Almost none. Three raked wavy lines between files and a 1px underline on search and fields.
    shadows: None. The selected row has a faint radial glow and its icon sits on a moon stone ringed by two raked circles.
    icons:
        18px line icons in muted grey, dark on the selected stone. Status
        words pair a filled star with Starred in pale gold, two heads with
        Shared with 4 people and an up arrow ring with Uploading 62% over
        a 2px moon thread.
    focus: A 1.5px pale gold outline with a 5px offset.
    tone: Hushed and brief, such as Details and 64.2 GB of 100 GB under the moon.
